 3. Concealer Dab under the eyes and on any blemishes. Blend with a small brush. Use a slightly lighter shade for under‑eye coverage. 
 4. Powder Lightly dust translucent powder over the T‑zone. Avoid heavy powder; a quick swipe keeps the look fresh. 
 5. Eyes 1️⃣ Apply a neutral base shade. 2️⃣ Add a darker shade in the crease. 3️⃣ Finish with mascara. For a subtle look, keep the eyeliner soft and smudged. 
